8-shenchong:origin:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"沈勁","kind":"person","person_id":"4c2_19b_bf4_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jin098-shenchong:origin:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"世堅","kind":"person","person_id":"4c2_19b_bf4_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jin098-shenchong:origin:m0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"充","kind":"person","person_id":"4c2_19b_bf4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jin098-shenchong:origin:m0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"王敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-089-jin098-shenchong:origin:m0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"吳儒","kind":"person","person_id":"fxt_25c_3fh","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","source_quote":{"witness":"j89","quote":"沈勁，字世堅，吳興武康人也。父[[晉書/卷098#沈充|充]]，與王敦構逆，眾敗而逃，為部曲將吳儒所殺。","raw_start":10094,"raw_end":10146,"raw_line":131,"normalization":"文庫交叉連結讀顯示字串。"},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-089-jin098-shenchong","book_id":"b-jinshu-089","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-089-jin098-shenchong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081","text":"既而周光斬錢鳳，吳儒斬沈充，並傳首京師。有司議曰：「王敦滔天作逆，有無君之心，宜依崔杼、王浚故事，剖棺戮屍，以彰元惡。」於是發瘞出屍，焚其衣冠，跽而刑之。敦、充首同日懸于南桁，觀者莫不稱慶。敦首既懸，莫敢收葬者。尚書令郗鑒言於帝曰：「昔王莽漆頭以輗車，董卓然腹以照市，王淩儭土，徐馥焚首。前朝誅楊駿等，皆先極官刑，後聽私殯。然《春秋》許齊襄之葬紀侯，魏武義王修之哭袁譚。由斯言之，王誅加於上，私義行於下。臣以為可聽私葬，於義為弘。」昭許之，於是敦家收葬焉。含父子乘單船奔荊州刺史王舒，舒使人沈之于江，餘黨悉平。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"周光","kind":"person","person_id":"fqd_otm_jc2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"錢鳳","kind":"person","person_id":"762_5c8_663","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"吳儒","kind":"person","person_id":"fxt_25c_3fh","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"沈充","kind":"person","person_id":"4c2_19b_bf4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"王敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0077","start":77,"end":78,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0222","start":222,"end":223,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0228","start":228,"end":229,"surface":"含","kind":"person","person_id":"mwc_md4_l0g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0239","start":239,"end":241,"surface":"王舒","kind":"person","person_id":"nbl_2bu_99w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0242","start":242,"end":243,"surface":"舒","kind":"person","person_id":"nbl_2bu_99w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":81,"last_line":81,"revision_id":2614273},"source_quote":{"witness":"j98","quote":"既而周光斬錢鳳，吳儒斬沈充，並傳首京師。有司議曰：「王敦滔天作逆，有無君之心，宜依崔杼、王浚故事，剖棺戮屍，以彰元惡。」於是發瘞出屍，焚其衣冠，跽而刑之。敦、充首同日懸于南桁，觀者莫不稱慶。敦首既懸，莫敢收葬者。尚書令郗鑒言於帝曰：「昔王莽漆頭以輗車，董卓然腹以照市，王淩儭土，徐馥焚首。前朝誅楊駿等，皆先極官刑，後聽私殯。然《春秋》許齊襄之葬紀侯，魏武義王修之哭袁譚。由斯言之，王誅加於上，私義行於下。臣以為可聽私葬，於義為弘。」昭許之，於是敦家收葬焉。含父子乘單船奔荊州刺史王舒，舒使人沈之于江，餘黨悉平。","raw_start":6824,"raw_end":7079,"raw_line":81},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-shenchong:line091","text":"明帝將伐敦，遣其鄉人沈禎諭充，許以為司空。充謂禎曰：「三司具瞻之重，豈吾所任！幣厚言甘，古人所畏。且丈夫共事，終始當同，寧可中道改易，人誰容我！」禎曰：「不然。舍忠與順，未有不亡者也。大將軍阻兵不朝，爵賞自己，五尺之童知其異志。今此之舉，將行篡弑耳，豈同於往年乎？是以疆場諸將莫不歸赴本朝，內外之士咸願致死，正以移國易主，義不北面以事之也，奈何協同逆圖，當不義之責乎！朝廷坦誠，禎所知也。賊之黨類，猶宥其罪，與之更始，況見機而作邪！」充不納。率兵臨發，謂其妻子曰：「男兒不豎豹尾，終不還也。」及敗歸吳興，亡失道，誤入其故將吳儒家。儒誘充內重壁中，因笑謂充曰：「三千戶侯也。」充曰：「封侯不足貪也。爾以大義存我，我宗族必厚報汝。若必殺我，汝族滅矣。」儒遂殺之。充子勁竟滅吳氏。勁見《忠義傳》。","annotation_status":"reviewed","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-shenchong:line091:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"明帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-shenchong:line091:m0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-shenchong:line091:m0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"沈禎","kind":"person","person_id":"1s9_r97_p85","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-shenchong:line091:m0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"充","kind":"person","person_id":"4c2_19b_bf4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-shenchong:line091:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"充","kind":"person","person_id":"4c2_19b_bf4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-shenchong:line091:m0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"禎","kind":"person","person_id":"1s9_r97_p85","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-shen